          "thread": "DeFi broker KYC mandate",
          "why": "The IRS attempt to force DeFi front-ends into KYC and 1099 reporting — and the industry fight to kill it — generated clicks across every stage: proposal, lawsuit, Senate repeal, and Trump signature."
