        },
        {
          "dimension": "Centralization",
          "level": "High",
          "note": "Centralized exchanges are the primary IRS data chokepoint: John Doe summonses against Kraken, Supreme Court refusal to block Coinbase data access, and the 1099-DA mandate all treat CEXs as the enforcement lever, making exchange-held assets far more surveilled than self-custodied ones.",
          "source": ""
        },
        {
          "dimension": "Market",
